description:
Teaches you the necessary abilities to tether an Elemental companion.

Teaches you Tether Elemental, Raise Elemental, Dismiss Elemental, Revive Elemental and Elemental Lore.

@ext:@s:93569:0@:ext@

Teaches you the necessary abilities to tame a Dragonkin companion.

Teaches you Tame Dragonkin, Call Dragonkin, Dismiss Dragonkin, Revive Dragonkin and Dragonkin Lore.

@ext:@s:93558:0@:ext@

|cFF66DDFFLevel 10 Passive|r
Teaches you |cffffffffSummon: Greater Imp|r and increases your expertise by $s3.
