|cFF66DDFFLevel 10 Passive|r
After activating |cFFFF9800Dawn|r, casting a Holy spell grants |cffffffffSunrise|r or casting a Fire spell grants |cffffffffSunset|r.

Entering |cffffffffSunrise|r or |cffffffffSunset|r prevents you from entering the other until you enter the next.
